# Daily Sniff / Wag Watch

- Draft-first. Cron may fetch, score, and draft. A human approves in `/admin/daily-sniff` before anything is public.
- Never auto-publish briefs. Do not wire draft → Wag Watch without an explicit publish step the owner asked for.
- Do not change cron jobs or `DAILY_SNIFF_CRON_SECRET` / admin token handling without asking.
- Drafts restate the source with attribution and a verification checklist. Do not invent times, prices, policies, or outcomes.
- Product mentions must be real catalog links (Shopify merch or Amazon gear already on the site). No phantom products.
- Wag Watch items stay sourced, dated, and draft-safe. Unknown stays unknown.
